{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36858","headline":"中元夜泊淮口 · 罗隐","name":"中元夜泊淮口","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"木叶回飘水面平，偶因孤棹已三更。\n秋凉雾露侵灯下，夜静鱼龙逼岸行。\n欹枕正牵题柱思，隔楼谁转遶梁声。\n锦帆天子狂魂魄，应过扬州看月明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}